:"2:163:5","a":"إِلَـٰهَ","t":"god","p":"N","tr":"ilāha","f":["MS","ACC"],"r":0,"l":74},{"i":"2:163:6","a":"إِلَّا","t":"except","p":"EXP","tr":"illā","l":15},{"i":"2:163:7","a":"هُوَ","t":"Him","p":"PRON","tr":"huwa","f":["3MS"],"l":20},{"i":"2:163:8","a":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","t":"the Most Gracious","p":"N","tr":"l-raḥmānu","f":["MS","NOM"],"r":20,"l":212,"g":[["ٱل","DET","prefix","Al"],["رَّحْ","N","stem","MS|NOM"]]},{"i":"2:163:9","a":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","t":"the Most Merciful","p":"ADJ","tr":"l-raḥīmu","f":["MS","NOM"],"r":20,"l":101,"g":[["ٱل","DET","prefix","Al"],["رَّحِيمُ","ADJ","stem","MS|NOM"]]},{"e":"١٦٣","v":"2:163"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"2:154","t":"And do not say about those who are killed in the way of Allāh, \"They are dead.\" Rather, they are alive, but you perceive [it] not.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":154,"sd":null},{"k":"2:155","t":"And We will surely test you with something of fear and hunger and a loss of wealth and lives and fruits, but give good tidings to the patient,","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":155,"sd":null},{"k":"2:156","t":"Who, when disaster strikes them, say, \"Indeed we belong to Allāh, and indeed to Him we will return.\"","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":156,"sd":null},{"k":"2:157","t":"Those are the ones upon whom are blessings from their Lord and mercy. And it is those who are the [rightly] guided.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":157,"sd":null},{"k":"2:158","t":"Indeed, aṣ-Ṣafā and al-Marwah are among the symbols of Allāh. So whoever makes ḥajj [pilgrimage] to the House or performs ʿumrah - there is no blame upon him for walking between them. And whoever volunteers good - then indeed, Allāh is Appreciative and Knowing.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":158,"sd":null},{"k":"2:159","t":"Indeed, those who conceal what We sent down of clear proofs and guidance after We made it clear for the people in the Scripture - those are cursed by Allāh and cursed by those who curse,","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":159,"sd":null},{"k":"2:160","t":"Except for those who repent and correct themselves and make evident [what they concealed]. Those - I will accept their repentance, and I am the Accepting of Repentance, the Merciful.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":160,"sd":null},{"k":"2:161","t":"Indeed, those who disbelieve and die while they are disbelievers - upon them will be the curse of Allāh and of the angels and the people, all together,","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":161,"sd":null},{"k":"2:162","t":"Abiding eternally therein. The punishment will not be lightened for them, nor will they be reprieved.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":162,"sd":null},{"k":"2:163","t":"And your god is one God. There is no deity [worthy of worship] except Him, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":163,"sd":null}],"juz":2,"hizb":3,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}